     1	/**
     2	 * Deterministic outer dev-loop lifecycle state model.
     3	 *
     4	 * This module defines the sequential lifecycle phases — issue_intake →
     5	 * refinement → implementation → draft_gate → feedback_resolution →
     6	 * pre_approval_gate → merge — as a consultable graph so skills use
     7	 * machine-resolved state instead of restating the flow in prose.
     8	 *
     9	 * This module provides:
    10	 * - LIFECYCLE_STATE: stable phase name constants
    11	 * - LIFECYCLE_TRANSITIONS: legal transition graph between phases
    12	 * - LIFECYCLE_GRAPH: metadata (start, end, entry, terminal, nonterminal)
    13	 * - LIFECYCLE_NEXT_ACTIONS: recommended next action for each phase
    14	 * - resolveLifecycleState: resolver that maps inputs to one lifecycle phase
    15	 * - getAllowedTransitions: helper to list allowed next phases
    16	 * - COPILOT_INNER_STATE_MAP: maps lifecycle phases to copilot-loop-state.mjs inner states
    17	 *
    18	 * Contract guarantees:
    19	 * - One deterministic lifecycle phase per normalized input set
    20	 * - Ambiguous or incomplete inputs fall back to issue_intake
    21	 * - Transition graph enforces legal phase progression
    22	 * - Purely functional; no I/O or side effects
    23	 *
    24	 * Integration boundary:
    25	 * - Skills call resolveLifecycleState to determine current phase
    26	 * - Copilot-loop-state.mjs remains the inner machine for the Copilot review portion
    27	 * - Lifecycle phases are the outer sequence; inner states are sub-phase detail
    28	 */
